v = "$version.major.$version.minor.$version.patch"

: help
:
$* --help >>~"%EOO%"
%Tracy Profiler $v / v$v%
%.*%*
EOO

: missing-file
:
$* missing.tracy 2>>EOE == 1
Cannot open trace file: missing.tracy
EOE

: not-a-trace
:
echo 'not a trace' >=bad.tracy;
$* bad.tracy 2>>EOE == 1
The file you are trying to open is not a tracy dump.
EOE
